Ask "Bill amount?" and call the answer bill.
Ask "How many people?" and call the answer people.
Ask "How was service? good, okay or bad" and call the answer service.
If service is good, let tip be 20 percent of bill.
If service is okay, let tip be 15 percent of bill.
If service is bad, let tip be 10 percent of bill.
Let total be bill plus tip.
Let each be total divided by people.
Show "Tip: $" plus tip.
Show "Total: $" plus total.
Show "Each person pay: $" plus each.
